you have to build a new kernel able to detect the new device.
I have added a storage Works on a alpha server 2100 and followed
this procedure :
	- rename the kernel : mv vmunix vmunix.old (for security)
	- shutdown -h now
	- boot -file genvmunix : boot on the default kernel
	- tape doconfig to configure and build a new kernel
	- put the new kernel in root dir. : mv /sys/YOUR_HOSTNAME/vmunix /
	- reboot your server, and make the device : cd /dev, MAKEDEV rmt.
+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
