The size of the colormap table is imposed by your graphics hardware
(256 colours in your case).  If you want more, get a true colour 
graphics card (one for TurboChannel, of course).

Another solution is to try to start the "offending" application in its
own colourmap, if possible.  This might give you genuine headaches,
however (experiment with xv or netscape, which have this capability).
 
