This is probably because (a) you're using Tk 3.6 and (b) you've got
a NumLock or some other modifier lock set.  Tk 3.6 is too sensitive
to modifiers:  if you have extra ones present, event bindings don't
match.  This problem is fixed in Tk 4.0, or you can just turn off
the NumLock.



