provides an overview on how DCE Security is used to protect resources
in a 
distributed environment.  The seminar will address integrating DCE
Security 
in Legacy Systems and how DCE Security is used to provide an integrated

logon.  The new security features of DCE 1.1 will be introduced along
with 
