an FAQ entry in Solaris's FAQ.  I also found that SUN paid
more attention to that newsgroup. CSLIP and PPP have been
working on SUN OS and Solaris long before on DEC OSF.

This makes me wonder.  DEC Alpha is not a bad machine.
But Digital is far behind SUN and several other major UNIX
vendors.  Even a small potato customer like me often wish
that I had a SUN instead of DEC Alpha.  If DEC cares a little
bit more about its ordinary customers, they will certainly
