I own a Sun running SunOS, have an Alpha runniung Digital UNIX on my desk, and
regularly use a Sun running Solaris. Since the Sun involves my own money, I may
have a bit of bias, but I would rate Digital UNIX (3.2) as best, SunOS
(4.1.3_U1) as a close second, and Solaris (2.4) as a very distant third.

