since DECladebug was in fact designed for C++.  It has subsequently
grown to support C, Fortran, Ada and Cobol.  Any problems you are
experiencing should be reported as bugs.  The Ada team, in cooperation
with the DECladebug team, put a lot of effort into Ada debugging support
for DECladebug V3.0-16 (shipped with DEC OSF/1 V3.2, now Digital Unix).

