We have two OSF/1 systems, one running OSF/1 2.0 and one running OSF/1 3.2.
Under a heavy load the 2.0 system starts reporting "too many open files" when
there are about 1500 files open system-wide. On the 3.2 system, we have no
problems, and a single process successfully grabs 4096 files. I checked the
