Tom Techoueyres <tom@neptune.com> wrote:
>We are running sendmail on an alpha 2100 running osf/1, but when we try to 
>retrieve mail from the server using eudora on a pc workstation, we get a 
>"connection refused". Are there parameters in the sendmail.cf  file that we 
>should configure for a pc workstation to be able to retrieve mail from the 
>mail server?
