Ayman Ghanem <ayman@crg50.atmos.uiuc.edu> wrote:
>I have an Alpha AXP 3000/600 running OSF/1 2.0 which is trying to mount
>an NFS from another Ultrix machine. When I try to mount the NFS on the
>Alpha I get the message:
>
>NFS Portmap: RPC: Program not registered

If this is the first time you have exported a filesystem from this machine,
you need to create an /etc/exports file to indicate which filesystems
are exported to which machines, then either reboot the system, or
start the NFS services manually by executing: /sbin/init.d/nfs start
Once NFS services are running, changes to /etc/exports are detected
automatically.

