|> 
|> How do I set a normal user account so they have enough permissions to 
|> perform an su to root? I get the message: 'You do not have permission 
|> to su root'. I can also only login as root from the console and not 
|> remotely, so I have a problem in remote managing these systems at the 
|> moment.
