francois CARTIER (cartier@lcus15.saclay.cea.fr) wrote:
: For porting reasons, i need to get programaticaly the Ethernet
: adress of lan card of my alphastation 250 under OSF1.
: Whith my HP machines, it is done by un undocumented call to
:     ioctl(fd, NETSTAT, &arg).
: I suppose that some equivalent stuff exist whith OSF1.
: thanks for helping me..
: 
: Francois Cartier
: CEA- CE Saclay ** CEREM-STA-LCUS
: 91191 Gif sur Yvette  FRANCE
