think. The 9 GB do work, with some gotchas - mostly that you need more
power and better cooling or they will overheat or blow power supply fuses.
More so, they definitely do not work with the SWXCR or PCI version of the
RAID controller. I am told they also do not work with the HSx40
controllers in striping configurations. If you have the option, the 4GB
drive might be less hassle.

